        "console": [
          "Recording reproducibility input hashes…\n",
          "Reproducibility manifest: /home/olafsson/.spacr/runs/2026-09-11_044535_29d58e9a__barcode_qc\n",
          "[settings] ERROR [src]: src is missing from the settings.\n",
          "[settings]     Set src to the folder holding the images (or, for measure, the merged folder).\n",
          "Target: 5 gRNAs per well (median). Derived abundance threshold: 0.0121 (1.21% of a well's reads).\n",
          "At 0.0121 the median well carries 5.0 gRNAs and 100% of wells are retained (384 of 384); 40% of wells hold more than 5 gRNAs and so cannot have a phenotype attributed to a single guide. 58% of mapped reads survive.\n",
          "Every cutoff from 0.0112 to 0.0132 gives the same median of 5.0; 0.0121 is the geometric middle of that range and so the point least sensitive to a re-run. The collision rate does still vary across the range — see the sweep — which is why the middle is the number to quote and not either edge.\n",
          "Relaxing to 0.0086 takes the median to 8.0 gRNAs per well and the collision rate to 72%, for +0 percentage points of well retention.\n",
          "Tightening to 0.0172 drops the median to 4.0 gRNAs per well and retention to 100%.\n",
          "Below 0.0121 the collision rate rises sharply: 40% at 0.0121 becomes 72% at 0.0086. That is the floor worth defending.\n"
        ],
